  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Diakonia: Paritetsdemokrati Latinamerika 2023-2027</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Diakonia: Parity Democracy Latin America 2023-2027 - Diakonia: Parity Democracy Latin America 2024-2027</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the contribution is to promote democratic, egalitarian, inclusive, and representative decision-making processes at the regional level. The specific objective is to strengthen gender parity in democracy at all levels of participation and decision-making in the public and political life of women in Latin America. These objectives will be achieved through three results: 

Result 1: Feminist and women&apos;s organizations expand political rights in favor of women through democratic frameworks and public policies aimed at achieving substantive equality.

Result 2: Strengthened coordinated advocacy among feminist movements, alliances, diverse feminist and women&apos;s expressions, and other allied actors for the adoption of global standards that consolidate Gender Parity Democracy.
 
Result 3: A strengthened regional civic agenda for democracy based on the principles of justice, gender parity, and secularism.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The title of the contribution is: Parity Program for the Strengthening of the substantive participation of women, in their diversity, in Latin America and the Caribbean,

The Overall Objective is to promote democratic, egalitarian, inclusive and representative decision-making processes at the regional level.

The Specific Objective is to improve the application of substantive parity at all levels of participation and decision-making in the public, economic and political life of women in Latin America.

The programme has a regional perspective by addressing some of the challenges to achieving substantive democracies and parity that transcend national boundaries but are common to countries. In summary, it seeks to:

-Strengthen regional actors and solutions and capacity for cooperation in the region, in particular for gender equality and women&apos;s empowerment through targeted training for women from civil society organizations and women in decision-making positions (in legislative, executive, and judicial branches) to equip them with tools and knowledge to advance the definition and implementation of regional and national agendas on women&apos;s rights and the fight against violence.

-Strengthen the conditions for political participation, exercise of citizenship, transparency, and accountability through direct support to civil society networks and organizations to advance their agendas for the promotion, exercise, and defense of their rights (including Afro-descendant women, rural women and youth).

-Enhance capacities, cooperation and dialogue between civil society actors with national and regional institutions. Contribute to cultural change through the promotion of positive messages on gender equality, justice, democracy and the secular state.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Titeln p&#xE5; bidraget: J&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhetsprogram f&#xF6;r att st&#xE4;rka kvinnors, i deras m&#xE5;ngfald, reella deltagande i Latinamerika och Karibien.
Det &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att fr&#xE4;mja demokratiska, j&#xE4;mlika, inkluderande och representativa beslutsprocesser p&#xE5; regional niv&#xE5;.
Det specifika m&#xE5;let &#xE4;r att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra till&#xE4;mpningen av faktisk j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet p&#xE5; alla niv&#xE5;er av deltagande och beslutsfattande i det offentliga, ekonomiska och politiska livet f&#xF6;r kvinnor i Latinamerika.
Programmet har ett regionalt perspektiv d&#xE5; det adresserar n&#xE5;gra av de existerande utmaningarna f&#xF6;r att uppn&#xE5; demokrati och j&#xE4;mlikhet som &#xF6;verskrider nationella gr&#xE4;nser och som &#xE4;r gemensamma f&#xF6;r olika l&#xE4;nder. Sammanfattningsvis syftar programmet till att: 
-St&#xE4;rka regionala akt&#xF6;rer samt utveckla l&#xF6;sningar och kapacitet f&#xF6;r samarbete i regionen, med s&#xE4;rskilt fokus p&#xE5; j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet och kvinnors egenmakt. Detta ska uppn&#xE5;s genom riktad utbildning f&#xF6;r kvinnor fr&#xE5;n civilsamh&#xE4;llesorganisationer och kvinnor i beslutsfattande positioner (inom lagstiftande, verkst&#xE4;llande och d&#xF6;mande makten) f&#xF6;r att ge dem verktyg och kunskap att fr&#xE4;mja och genomf&#xF6;ra regionala och nationella agendor f&#xF6;r kvinnors r&#xE4;ttigheter och bek&#xE4;mpning av v&#xE5;ld.
-St&#xE4;rka f&#xF6;ruts&#xE4;ttningarna f&#xF6;r politiskt deltagande, ut&#xF6;vande av medborgarskap, transparens och ansvarsskyldighet genom direkt st&#xF6;d till civilsamh&#xE4;llets n&#xE4;tverk och organisationer f&#xF6;r att fr&#xE4;mja deras agendor f&#xF6;r fr&#xE4;mjande, ut&#xF6;vande och f&#xF6;rsvar av deras r&#xE4;ttigheter (inklusive kvinnor med afrikanskt ursprung, kvinnor p&#xE5; landsbygden och ungdomar).
-St&#xE4;rka kapacitet, samarbete och dialog mellan civilsamh&#xE4;llets akt&#xF6;rer och nationella och regionala institutioner. Bidra till kulturell f&#xF6;r&#xE4;ndring genom att fr&#xE4;mja positiva budskap om j&#xE4;mst&#xE4;lldhet, r&#xE4;ttvisa, demokrati och den sekul&#xE4;ra staten.</narrative>
  </description>
